# "Landfall -- whenever a land you control enters" is for any reason, not only playing a land (the ruling): Bot1 plays Fabled Passage
# (one trigger: Bot2 19), then cracks it ({T}, sacrifice) to search for a Mountain put onto the battlefield tapped (a second
# trigger: Bot2 18). The Passage leaving the battlefield is not a land entering.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Iridescent Vinelasher
Fabled Passage
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Iridescent Vinelasher.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search(Mountain)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Iridescent Vinelasher; Mountain
